'''Army Group East''', abbreviated as '''AGEAST''' and officially known as the '''25th Army Group''', was a [[United States Army]] army group formed on the east coast of the [[United States of America|United States]] during the [[White Tide]]. Along with [[AGWEST|Army Group West (AGWEST)]], it formed a significant part of the Federal government's forces against the MAGA government's [[National Defense Force]].

